\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10.3}{\ignorespaces Revised vision pipeline using YOLOv26n-pose for joint detection and keypoint regression, followed by PnP-based 6-DoF pose estimation.}}{74}{figure.10.3}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10.4}{\ignorespaces Keypoint convention for both object classes. TFL, TFR, TBL, and TBR denote the four corners of the top face as seen from the overhead camera.}}{75}{figure.10.4}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10.5}{\ignorespaces Dataset curation pipeline. Three annotation sources are converted to a unified YOLO pose format with 2 classes and 4 keypoints per instance.}}{77}{figure.10.5}%
